he only one still at its original site.", "original_document_number": 3}], "initial_answers": ["1 Depot Street in the center of Raymond, New Hampshire", "1 Depot Street in the center of Salem, Massachusetts", "36 Pine Street in Stoneham, Massachusetts"]}
